From 5d577f47109bcf4825e966440e101095672718ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 13:10:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] implement complete password reset flow (forgot + reset
 endpoints + UI)

Added components:
- create /api/auth/forgot-password endpoint: generates reset token and sends email
- create /api/auth/reset-password endpoint: validates token and updates password
- create reset-password-fresh.tsx page: allows user to enter new password
- add /auth/reset-password route to routes.tsx

Password Reset Flow:
1. User clicks 'Forgot password?' on login page
2. Enters email and submits to /api/auth/forgot-password
3. Backend generates reset token and sends email with reset link
4. User clicks link in email (token + email in URL)
5. User arrives at /auth/reset-password page
6. Enters new password and submits to /api/auth/reset-password
7. Backend validates token, hashes password, updates account
8. User redirected to login with success message

Security Features:
- Reset tokens expire after 24 hours
- Tokens are SHA256 hashed before storage
- Email enumeration protection (don't reveal if email exists)
- Password hashing with bcrypt (cost: 12)
- Tokens invalidated after successful reset

